Description: Configuration and glue for the multiroom-audio endpoint
 The architecture-independent half of a multiroom-audio endpoint: the
 audio-claim, ready-chime, chime-gate, multiroom-update and readonly-root
 helpers, the boot/tuning scripts, the ready/fail chimes, the static systemd
 units, sudoers and tmpfiles rules, the per-device config templates, the apt
 archive public key and the multiroom-configure command. Everything is
 installed under /usr/local and /usr/share, matching scripts/setup.sh.
 The three compiled programs are separate packages.

